  "description": "<p>The GEL-KAYANO 14 sneaker resurfaces with its late 2000s aesthetic as a nod to our storied GEL-KAYANO legacy. Reinventing the shoe's performance capabilities with updated technological components, this version became the first iteration in the sneaker's lineage to implement our Impact Guidance System (I.G.S.) technology.</p><br><p>The upper construction of this shoe is built with a combination of mesh and synthetic leather materials that offer a supportive fit. Underfoot, GEL technology cushioning is placed in the rearfoot and forefoot to help soften landings and create smoother transitions.</p>",
